<title>UK: GEC Marconi to get 2 bln pound UK sub order.</title>
<headline>GEC Marconi to get 2 bln pound UK sub order.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Defence Secretary Michael Portillo is expected to announce shortly that Britain will give GEC Marconi a two billion pound order for three nuclear-powered submarines, defence sources said.</p>
<p>The sources, which asked not to be identified, said the Trafalgar class submarines would be built at GEC's VSEL Barrow shipyard.  </p>
<p>The defence sources said Portillo would make the announcement &quot;in the next few days&quot;.</p>
<p>A spokesman for GEC Marconi declined to comment, saying no official announcement had yet been made.</p>
</text>
